### RxBox API — requests de ejemplo
### VS Code (extensión REST Client / "HTTP") y Rider ejecutan este archivo.
### Cambia @host al puerto donde corras la API (5080 con `dotnet run`).
### La colección completa está en docs/postman/RxBox.postman_collection.json.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@contentType = application/json

### Health — no requiere autenticación
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Swagger JSON (solo en Development)
GET {{host}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: {{contentType}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  Auth
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login — un box: tokens. Varios: requiereSeleccion, boxes y selectionToken.
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@rxbox.local",
  "password": "cambia-esto"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}
@selectionToken = {{login.response.body.$.selectionToken}}
@boxPublicId = {{login.response.body.$.boxes[0].publicId}}

### Seleccionar box (tras un login con varios boxes)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/seleccionar-box
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "selectionToken": "{{selectionToken}}",
  "boxPublicId": "{{boxPublicId}}"
}

### Cambiar de box sin pedir contraseña
POST {{host}}/api/auth/cambiar-box
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "boxPublicId": "{{boxPublicId}}"
}

### Refresh — rota el refresh token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout — revoca el refresh token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
